 use the Online Booking Service to make legitimate appointments.</p>\n<p>We will use our reasonable commercial efforts to keep the Online Booking Service available on a 24 hour/7days a week basis, subject to necessary scheduled downtime for maintenance, unscheduled maintenance and system outages.&nbsp; Your access to our Online Booking Service may not be uninterrupted or available at all times.&nbsp; We cannot promise that our Online Booking Service will be error-free, that defects or errors will be corrected or that our site or the servers that make it available are free from viruses or other harmful components.&nbsp; You will not use any device, software or routine that interferes or attempts to interfere with the normal operation of this site or take any action that imposes an unreasonable load on our computer equipment.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;No-Show Policy<br>--------------------<br>We are committed to providing superior quality services to our clients. Customers are asked to cancel any appointments that they will be unable to honour at least 24 hours in advance of their reservation.&nbsp; You may be required to telephone the salon directly to cancel.</p></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2629771415=\"\" class=\"mx-auto text-center ps-2 mt-3 mb-3\"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2629771415=\"\" class=\"scs-small\"></div><!----><!----><!----></div></sc-terms-condition><!----></div><div class=\"border-left col-3 col-md-5 d-none d-sm-block p-0 site-detail-page\"><sc-site-detail class=\"border-0 d-flex flex-grow-1 h-100 modal-content rounded-0\"><sc-modal-body class=\"modal-body modal-container\"><!----><!----><div><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-100\" src=\"https://sc-ols.s3.amazonaws.com/company-21295/olb-feature-image.png?2026-05-10T11:00:00\"></div><!----><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center px-3\"><div class=\"w-25\"><!----><!----><!----><sc-logo-image><div class=\"logo-thumbna